---
description: Git branching rule — always branch, never commit directly to main
globs: []
alwaysApply: true
---

Always check out a dedicated branch before starting any story, task, fix, or experiment. Never commit directly to `main`.

Every piece of work — implementation, spec, planning-artifact update, or one-off fix — goes on its own branch. Branch naming: `feature/<story-key-or-slug>`, `fix/<slug>`, `chore/<slug>`. `main` receives changes only via PR merge.
